<section class="surfdoc-section">
<h1 id="q1-2026-product-strategy-review">Q1 2026 Product Strategy Review</h1>

<div class="surfdoc-summary" role="doc-abstract"><div class="surfdoc-summary-label">Summary</div><p>CloudSurf is executing a multi-product strategy with TaskSurf as the lead product.
Revenue target is $5K MRR by end of Q2, driven by TaskSurf subscriptions and
Wavesite upsells. Patent portfolio provides defensive moat with 16 families filed.</p></div>
</section>
<section class="surfdoc-section">
<h2 id="current-product-status">Current Product Status</h2>

<div class="surfdoc-table-wrap"><table class="surfdoc-data"><thead><tr><th scope="col" aria-sort="none">Product</th><th scope="col" aria-sort="none">Stage</th><th scope="col" aria-sort="none">MRR</th><th scope="col" aria-sort="none">Users</th><th scope="col" aria-sort="none">Priority</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>TaskSurf</td><td>Beta</td><td class="num">$0</td><td class="num">12</td><td>P0</td></tr><tr><td>Wavesite</td><td>Production</td><td class="num">$500</td><td class="num">45</td><td>P1</td></tr><tr><td>NoteSurf</td><td>Alpha</td><td class="num">$0</td><td class="num">8</td><td>P2</td></tr><tr><td>SurfContext</td><td>OSS</td><td class="num">$0</td><td class="num">0</td><td>P1</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
<div class="surfdoc-callout surfdoc-callout-tip" role="note"><svg class="surfdoc-callout-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M9 18h6M10 22h4M12 2a7 7 0 0 0-4 12.7c.6.5 1 1.3 1 2.1h6c0-.8.4-1.6 1-2.1A7 7 0 0 0 12 2z"/></svg><div class="surfdoc-callout-body"><div class="surfdoc-callout-title">Revenue Priority</div><p>Focus engineering effort on TaskSurf billing activation. Every week of delay
costs approximately $2K in potential MRR based on pipeline conversations.</p>
</div></div>
</section>
<section class="surfdoc-section">
<h2 id="key-decisions">Key Decisions</h2>

<article class="surfdoc-decision surfdoc-decision-accepted" role="note" aria-label="Decision: accepted"><div class="surfdoc-decision-header"><span class="surfdoc-decision-status surfdoc-decision-status--accepted">Accepted</span><span class="surfdoc-decision-date">2026-02-08</span></div><div class="surfdoc-decision-body"><p>Absorb CloudSurf HQ into TaskSurf. The standalone dashboard adds maintenance
overhead without differentiated value. AI chat, agent personas, and strategy
features become TaskSurf premium tier capabilities.</p>
</div></article>
<article class="surfdoc-decision surfdoc-decision-proposed" role="note" aria-label="Decision: proposed"><div class="surfdoc-decision-header"><span class="surfdoc-decision-status surfdoc-decision-status--proposed">Proposed</span><span class="surfdoc-decision-date">2026-02-10</span></div><div class="surfdoc-decision-body"><p>Evaluate SST v3 migration for TaskSurf backend. Amplify Gen 2 is blocking
custom domain configuration and advanced caching. Migration cost estimated
at 2-3 engineering days.</p>
</div></article>
</section>
