<section class="surfdoc-section">
<h2 id="risk-assessment">Risk Assessment</h2>

<div class="surfdoc-callout surfdoc-callout-danger" role="alert"><svg class="surfdoc-callout-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><line x1="15" y1="9" x2="9" y2="15"/><line x1="9" y1="9" x2="15" y2="15"/></svg><div class="surfdoc-callout-body"><p>Single-founder dependency remains the highest operational risk. Brady is the
sole engineer, designer, and business operator. Any extended absence would
halt all product development across the portfolio.</p>
</div></div>
<figure class="surfdoc-code"><figcaption class="surfdoc-code-head"><span class="surfdoc-code-file">risk-matrix.toml</span><span class="surfdoc-code-lang">TOML</span></figcaption><pre aria-label="toml code" data-lang="toml"><code class="language-toml">[risks.founder-dependency]
severity = &quot;critical&quot;
likelihood = &quot;medium&quot;
mitigation = &quot;Document everything, automate CI/CD, maintain ARDS&quot;

[risks.runway]
severity = &quot;high&quot;
likelihood = &quot;low&quot;
mitigation = &quot;Client services revenue covers burn for 12+ months&quot;</code></pre></figure>
</section>
